## 8. Theorem

The selected q79 bulk Dirac data define a canonical bulk-to-boundary
Dirac/APS/BFV functor after the typed package (3.1) is supplied. The previous
finite crossing is exactly homotopic, through one-crossing self-adjoint
families, to a three-mode Galerkin restriction of the continuum circle Dirac
family (4.1). However, current q79 bulk geometry and sign holonomy admit both
spectral-flow-zero and spectral-flow-one loops. They therefore cannot select
the physical noncollar boundary family.

Accordingly:

```text
